lede: Find concepts, guides, tutorials, and reference material across the PicoFlow documentation.
---
<div class="docs-search" data-search-root>
  <form class="docs-search__form" action="/docs/search/" method="get" role="search">
    <label for="docs-search-input">Search the documentation</label>
    <div class="docs-search__controls">
      <input id="docs-search-input" name="q" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Try “session migration”, “tools”, or “hotel flow”" data-search-input>
      <button type="submit">Search</button>
    </div>
  </form>
  <p class="docs-search__status" data-search-status>Start typing to search the full PicoFlow documentation.</p>
  <div class="docs-search__results" data-search-results aria-live="polite"></div>
  <noscript><p class="callout callout--note"><span class="callout__title">Search needs JavaScript</span><span>Use the navigation above, or enable JavaScript to search the full documentation index.</span></p></noscript>
</div>
